<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sharon et al. (2002) Nature / Audoly & Boudaoud (2003) PRL Non-Euclidean Edge Buckling Cascades in Ruffled Leaf Margins — Model fidelity to source: 56/100" ;
