<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sharon et al. (2002) Nature / Audoly & Boudaoud (2003) PRL Non-Euclidean Edge Buckling Cascades in Ruffled Leaf Margins — MorphoEval overall 55.4/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py` (overall weighted score: 56.2/100). The baseline evaluates the analytical isometric aspect ratio A/lambda and plots a kinematic sinusoidal superposition, but lacks variational L-BFGS-B minimization of the 2D non-Euclidean Föppl-von Kármán thin-sheet energy E = E_stretch + E_bend across sheet thickness t and marginal growth profile g_yy(x), omits the Brioschi negative Gaussian curvature profile K(x) < 0, omits the Liang & Mahadevan (2009) saddle-to-ripple transition and multi-system taxon comparison, and does not segment the vendored Lactuca sativa 'Lollo Bionda' ruffled leaf specimen image. Overall 55.4/100 (faithfulness 51.6, reproducibility 64.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 56, Morphological realism / specimen match 46, Parameter expressivity 52, Morphometric validation 55, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 61, Reproducibility package 63. Output judged: docs/media/ripping_leaf_edge_waves_comparison.png: rendered output of 2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py at 8871db0, image/png, 191980 B, 1430×624 px, artifact_sha256 378af2a5aeb7eb13fdbddbf55156d2e3534b823383f87695b2cbd71add999e59 (sha256 378af2a5aeb7eb13fdbddbf55156d2e3534b823383f87695b2cbd71add999e59), spec_fingerprint 7f611592e1fd4b993235be4db6e1a4477fa6a36fa0f4a6d7d8002d143a1ff98e. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 7f611592e1fd4b993235be4db6e1a4477fa6a36fa0f4a6d7d8002d143a1ff98e; artifact_sha256: 378af2a5aeb7eb13fdbddbf55156d2e3534b823383f87695b2cbd71add999e59; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/ripping_leaf_edge_waves/lactuca_sativa_edge_waves_specimen.jpg=921d920a85d530f7..., datasets/ripping_leaf_edge_waves/paper_citations.bib=d9c45c59e0864ec3..., datasets/ripping_leaf_edge_waves/ripping_leaf_edge_waves_reference.json=7791c76d9fb5bd78..., datasets/ripping_leaf_edge_waves/scout_manifest.json=9d72416d0542e21c...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Compute the exact Brioschi intrinsic Gaussian curvature K(x) < 0 profile, evaluate the Liang & Mahadevan (2009) saddle-to-ripple transition across dimensionless strain-to-thickness parameter Gamma = g_0*(ell/t)^2, and verify the flat Euclidean metric negative control (g_0 = 0 => w = 0, K = 0).",
        "remediation needed: Enforce runtime SHA-256 verification of all 4 dataset files, expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 9 quantitative reference-anchored metrics, and upgrade the figure to a 6-panel synthesis layout.",
        "remediation needed: Implement a variational L-BFGS-B energy minimizer for the 2D non-Euclidean Föppl-von Kármán thin-sheet energy functional E = E_stretch + E_bend across sheet thickness t and marginal growth profile g_yy(x) = 1 + g_0 exp(-x/ell), reproducing the multi-generation Fourier buckling cascade spectrum and self-similar collapse of w(x, y)/lambda(x).",
        "remediation needed: Implement computer-vision segmentation of `datasets/ripping_leaf_edge_waves/lactuca_sativa_edge_waves_specimen.jpg` (*Lactuca sativa* cv. 'Lollo Bionda'), extracting the ruffled canopy boundary and multi-scale marginal wave wavelengths & amplitudes across coarse lobes and fine micro-ruffles." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.54e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

